                                                "sense_id": "ddc7d3a8-275f-3ce8-8c46-e3ead40a75a7",
                                                "text": "His only remark was, \"There's some new stuff, cuticura or something, which is better than arnica.\" Some people have such extraordinary notions of humor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
